translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_5de9104e:

    # mc "Well... What you do with her is your business."
    mc "好吧……你跟她做什么都是你的事。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:219
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_0c238cbd:

    # mc "Both of you are making the same decision in there."
    mc "你们俩在那儿做着同样的决定。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:222
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_6e0ba5f5:

    # mc "I get it... You want her, but come on..."
    mc "我懂……你喜欢她，可是……"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:223
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_bf2d204a:

    # mc "You're better than this."
    mc "你不该干这种事。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:225
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_127d1b58:

    # mc "Trust me, this situation you're putting yourself in sucks for everyone involved."
    mc "相信我，你现在把自己陷入的这种局面，让所有卷进来的人全都糟心。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:228
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_f40f0375:

    # rs "She'll break up with him at some point; I can feel it."
    rs "她迟早会和他分手，我感觉到了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:231
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_41550776:

    # mc "I don't care. I'm staying out of it."
    mc "我不在乎。我打算置身事外。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:233
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_aa869f32:

    # rs "You don't care anymore?"
    rs "你现在已经不在乎了？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:235
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_a22cd7ad:

    # mc "What I mean is that you're free to make your own choices."
    mc "我的意思是说，你有自由去做出自己的选择。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:238
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_5dedf76b:

    # mc "Did she say that?"
    mc "她这么说的吗？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:240
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_8bc5cb45:

    # rs "I'm working on it."
    rs "我在想办法。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:242
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_73d02ea1:

    # mc "I won't tell you what to do, but I won't hide what I think."
    mc "我不会告诉你该怎么做，但我也不会藏着我对这件事的看法。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:243
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_daba1b41:

    # mc "This is a bad call."
    mc "这是个糟糕的决定。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:246
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_b90e686c:

    # rs "Well, it's what I choose."
    rs "好吧，这是我自己的选择。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:249
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_68f03e04:

    # mc "Cool..."
    mc "行吧……"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:251
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_2405dc04:

    # mc "Then don't let me bother you."
    mc "那我不打扰你了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:253
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_27d2f3a1:

    # mc "You can go back to ignoring me."
    mc "你可以继续无视我。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:255
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_bb0179c9:

    # rs "Hey... What's that supposed to mean?"
    rs "嘿... 你这话是什么意思？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:257
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_e728e418:

    # mc "Stop pretending you don't know what I'm talking about."
    mc "别装了，你明知道我在说什么。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:258
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_e764653e:

    # mc "You haven't even approached me to talk since Nick dropped that bomb about Jill. Did you expect me to forget about that?"
    mc "Nick爆出Jill那件事之后，你都没主动找我谈过。你指望我就这么忘了？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:260
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_7519ba39:

    # rs "What do you want me to say? That I liked Jill a lot?"
    rs "你想听我说什么？说我很喜欢过Jill？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:261
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_9d707250:

    # rs "Would that make you feel better?"
    rs "这会让你感觉好点吗？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:263
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_071cc4de:

    # mc "I thought you'd at least try to explain why he'd say such a hurtful thing."
    mc "我以为你至少会试着解释他为什么说那样伤人的话。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:265
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_92d36c4b:

    # rs "I'm trying to shut up and stay neutral because I don't intend to ruin your relationship with her."
    rs "我本来想保持沉默和中立，不想破坏你跟她之间的关系。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:266
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_d7669eff:

    # rs "Yes, there was some truth to what Nick said. But it wasn't yesterday I told him about Jill."
    rs "是，Nick说的有些是真的。但我跟他提Jill，已经是很久以前的事了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:268
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_5a082bd9:

    # rs "It was before you came here, and you two getting together changed things."
    rs "那是你来这里之前的事了，你们俩在一起之后才改变了局面。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:269
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_e5f6e3ac:

    # rs "But it doesn't take away that I regret how I acted and fucked up my chances with her."
    rs "但这不代表我就不后悔自己当时的行为，也不代表我没毁掉和她在一起的机会。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:271
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_21f41240:

    # rs "You don't have to worry. I don't look at Jill like someone who got away."
    rs "你不用担心。我没把Jill当成念念不忘的遗憾。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:272
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_45b95594:

    # rs "She's my wake-up call. She's the girl who made me realize that I was going down a path I didn't like with my frat mates."
    rs "她给我敲了警钟，让我意识到，我跟着兄弟会的朋友们走上了一条自己并不喜欢的路。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:274
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_6a7da3db:

    # rs "It's taken me a lot of willpower to try and change who I was."
    rs "花了我不少意志力才试着改变自己。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:275
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_ced8af96:

    # rs "Seeing her with you makes me think it could have been me. If I had only had the same courage as you do."
    rs "看到她和你在一起，我会想，原本站在她身边的人也可以是我。只要当时我也有你这样的勇气。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:277
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_0d52e38f:

    # rs "You don't play any games around her. Even during the Walk of Shame, you stuck up for her like it was nothing."
    rs "你从来不拿她开玩笑。就连羞耻游街的时候，你都毫不犹豫地站出来维护她。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:278
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_b7578cfc:

    # rs "You showed me how I should have acted back when I was in your position, but I didn't."
    rs "你让我看清了当初我处在你那个位置时应该怎么做，但我却没有做到。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:280
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_7955cc48:

    # rs "And yeah, that made me feel angry. But I was mostly angry at myself."
    rs "而且说实话，这让我很生气。但更多的是气自己。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:281
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_25535b80:

    # rs "Why couldn't I have done that?"
    rs "为什么我没能做到呢？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:283
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_a59bc021:

    # rs "It doesn't mean I hate you or resent your relationship with her."
    rs "这不代表我恨你，或者对你和她在一起的事心怀怨恨。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:284
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_c678e6db:

    # rs "I'm not denying that I'm jealous of what you got, but that speaks more to what I wish I had in my life."
    rs "我不是在否认我嫉妒你得到的东西，但这也更多说明了我这辈子到底想要什么。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:285
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_6722c0ac:

    # rs "It's not about Jill. Ok?"
    rs "我在意的不是非要和Jill在一起，明白吗？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:287
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_510f3d03:

    # mc "Why didn't you tell me this sooner?"
    mc "你为什么现在才告诉我这件事？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:289
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_aab7688f:

    # rs "Because I was ashamed, [name]. I couldn't deny what he said."
    rs "因为我感到羞耻，[name]我无法否认他说的话。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:291
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_32e90bfa:

    # rs "I'm not sure if you can relate to this, but..."
    rs "我不确定你能不能理解这种感觉，但..."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:292
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_33ef9ec8:

    # rs "No matter who the guy was, I always knew that seeing Jill in a relationship would hit me like a brick to the face."
    rs "不管那个男人是谁，我早就知道，看见Jill谈恋爱，都会像被砖头迎面砸中一样难受。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:294
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_97dc423d:

    # rs "And that guy happened to be you."
    rs "而且那个人刚好就是你。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:298
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_a55f7f51:

    # rs "[name], I'm sorry. It's nothing personal against you. It's my history with her."
    rs "[name]对不起，这和你没关系。这是我和她之间的旧账。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:303
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_b7418769:

    # mc "It's not fun to hear that you feel that way, but you need to find a way to deal with it."
    mc "听你这么说其实挺难受的，但你得想办法处理好这事儿。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:304
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_73bd1fd9:

    # mc "If you don't, it will be hard for me to stay your friend."
    mc "如果你不这样，对我来说，做你的朋友就会很难。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:306
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_611f2824:

    # rs "That's why I didn't talk to you about it. Maybe that was wrong, but I'm trying, [name]."
    rs "这就是为什么我没和你谈这件事。也许那是个错误，但我是在努力，[name]."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:310
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_afde332d:

    # mc "You're right. I can't relate to that, but I think I understand what you mean. Still... It hurt hearing it like that."
    mc "你没错。我没法感同身受，但我明白你的意思。不过……听到你这么说还是挺伤人的。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:312
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_1ad96b92:

    # mc "You're wrong. I can relate to that feeling. And I understand what you mean. Still... It hurt hearing it like that."
    mc "你错了。我其实能理解那种感觉。我明白你的意思。不过……听到你这么说还是让我很难受。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:314
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_1d9a3d16:

    # rs "Again... I'm sorry."
    rs "还是那句话……对不起。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:317
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_13611017:

    # mc "You said you didn't like the path you were going down..."
    mc "你跟我说你当初走的那条路一点都不喜欢……"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:318
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_546b3670:

    # mc "Do you like the path you're going down now with Micha any better?"
    mc "那现在你和Micha走的这条路，你就更喜欢吗？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:320
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_50836d7f:

    # rs "..."
    rs "..."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:321
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_94c100b8:

    # mc "You should think about that."
    mc "你最好好好想想。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:324
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_rm_event_label_08b5df7f:

    # mc "Ok."
    mc "嗯。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:343
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_d00657ce:

    # tm "What's the deal with all the lights outside? Are you trying to blind the neighbors?"
    tm "外面怎么这么多灯？你这是想把邻居的眼睛给晃瞎吗？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:345
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_bd953922:

    # jm "I think they look nice."
    jm "我觉得挺好看的。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:347
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_3cb2acc1:

    # tm "Nice? I saw an airplane trying to land in our backyard earlier."
    tm "好看？刚才我都看见一架飞机想降落在我们后院了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:349
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_f1eee75a:

    # jm "Ha-ha. Lighten up. Santa gotta park his sleigh somewhere. It's good that he can find the place."
    jm "哈，别那么较真。圣诞老人总得找个地方停他的雪橇嘛，他能找到这儿也是好事。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:351
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_1ad54e6b:

    # tm "You care too much about this stupid holiday."
    tm "你太在意这个蠢节日了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:353
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_292b3725:

    # jm "I saw you care about Christmas last year."
    jm "我去年就看出来你挺在意圣诞节的。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:355
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_3ba40648:

    # tm "The party, yeah. Because I get to dress up as Santa and make hot chicks sit in my lap!"
    tm "我在意的是派对！能扮圣诞老人，让辣妹坐我腿上！"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:357
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_1bcedea1:

    # jm "We like different things, Tommy. It's for one month of the year; I think you'll survive."
    jm "Tommy，我们喜欢的东西不一样。一年也就这一个月，你忍得过去的。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:361
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_0de7dbb9:

    # mc "About our Christmas party... The HOTs won't show for it. Alphas have called dibs."
    mc "说到我们的圣诞派对……HOT 那天来不了，三阿尔法先约了她们。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:365
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_58b7a0b5:

    # mc "For how long do you think he'll be upset with me?"
    mc "你觉得他会生我多久的气？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:367
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_e806d339:

    # jm "Did you apologize again?"
    jm "你又道歉了？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:369
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_72363a09:

    # mc "Several times..."
    mc "好几次了..."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:371
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_d32eb84b:

    # jm "I have never seen him forgive someone. And since I don't see it happening with Nick... I'm not sure about you either."
    jm "我就没见他原谅过谁。既然看不出他会原谅Nick……你这边我也不敢保证。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:373
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_fa45f281:

    # mc "Thanks..."
    mc "谢谢..."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:375
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_2f4aa659:

    # jm "You did a bad thing, [name]."
    jm "你做了一件蠢事。[name]."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:379
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_a37fc266:

    # mc "I know, but I couldn't help it. She threw herself at me, and she was so hot in that swimsuit."
    mc "我知道，可我没忍住。她自己扑上来的，而且穿那套泳衣真的很性感。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:381
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_8bfa65b0:

    # jm "If you're looking for sympathy, that's not the way to go at it."
    jm "如果你想指望得到同情，那可就走错门了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:382
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_49c4c54e:

    # jm "Tommy won't say this, so I will. You broke a bro code and you hurt him."
    jm "Tommy不会开口，我替他说。你坏了兄弟间的规矩，也伤了他。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:387
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_d4557011:

    # mc "I'm sorry, but he had it coming. You know how he treated Heather, yeah?"
    mc "抱歉，可他也是自找的。你知道他怎么对Heather的吧？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:388
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_cfd522ac:

    # mc "What kind of a relationship is that? I figured it wasn't that big of a deal since he fucks other girls."
    mc "什么鬼关系啊？我本来以为这事不算什么，毕竟他跟别的女孩上床本来就是家常便饭。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:390
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_b38f8904:

    # jm "It doesn't justify it. Especially not when it's your brother."
    jm "这不等于你没错。尤其是当你伤害的是你的兄弟。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:392
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_6543a5f6:

    # mc "Don't make me feel worse about it."
    mc "别让我觉得更糟。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:394
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_e5888462:

    # jm "I'm gonna because you should feel bad about it."
    jm "我得这么做，因为你该为这事感到难过。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:397
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_tj_event_label_3f67f702:

    # mc "*{i}Sigh{/i}* What can I do to make it better? He won't talk to me."
