# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1269
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_2ffae718:

    # ly "You know it doesn't look bad; it looks good. We look good together."
    ly "你知道的，这看起来一点都不差，反而很好看。我们在一起看起来很棒。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1271
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_1b9701c5:

    # mc "Maybe it looks bad when you talk about what you're gonna do to me and when we grope each other in public."
    mc "也许当你说到要对我做什么，还有我们在公共场合互相摸来摸去的时候，看起来就不太好。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1273
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_045f5aae:

    # ly "I knew she put these thoughts in your head. I'm gonna talk to her."
    ly "我知道她把这种想法塞进你脑子里了。我要跟她谈谈。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1275
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_d3962114:

    # mc "Wait. Don't... There's no need to do that."
    mc "等一下。别……没必要这么做。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1277
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_5095a11e:

    # ly "[name]... I'm not forcing you to do any of this, am I? Didn't you want this?"
    ly "[name]...我是不是逼你做这些的？你不是想要的吗？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1279
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_a3cd1a9f:

    # mc "I wanted to try it, yeah. I wasn't sure what it entailed, and honestly, it's not gotten much clearer with time."
    mc "我想试试看，嗯。我当时不清楚这到底意味着什么，说实话，时间过去这么久，事情也没变得更清楚。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1280
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_52799bf6:

    # mc "But I am fine with it. However, I didn't think about what others would think of me."
    mc "但我没什么大不了。只是我没想过别人会怎么看我。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1282
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_8fb3368f:

    # ly "And why does it matter if someone doesn't like seeing it? People will judge you no matter what you do."
    ly "那又怎样，有人不喜欢看到这个？不管你做什么，别人总会对你指手画脚。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1283
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_cbed9435:

    # ly "You can be the most perfect girl in school and get ridiculed because you're too smart or ugly..."
    ly "你可以在学校里是最完美的女孩，却因为太聪明或者太丑被嘲笑……"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1285
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_4d193ba7:

    # ly "...or you can dress slutty and act cool, but others will think you're trash."
    ly "或者你穿得花枝招展装作很酷，别人照样觉得你是个渣女。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1286
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_4c84c659:

    # ly "There's no way to please all people, so please yourself."
    ly "没人能讨好所有人，所以讨好自己。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1288
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_3eeb17d3:

    # ly "..."
    ly "..."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1290
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_7a8622ea:

    # ly "And yeah, I'm talking about myself."
    ly "而且，我说的就是我自己。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1292
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_d080aba3:

    # mc "I figured you were. I'm not a perfect girl."
    mc "我猜你是这个意思。我不是完美的女孩。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1298
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_2b789b66:

    # ly "I'm not stupid. I know what people think when they look at me."
    ly "我不是傻子。我知道人们看到我时在想什么。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1299
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_9b47858f:

    # ly "They see this girl who dresses provocatively and oozes confidence."
    ly "他们看到的是一个穿着性感、充满自信的女孩。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1300
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_9bf5995c:

    # ly "They most likely think I've got daddy issues and come from a broken home, but that's so fucking far from the truth."
    ly "他们大概觉得我缺父爱，来自破碎的家庭。可事实他妈的根本不是这样。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1302
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_1837f4a0:

    # ly "I wasn't always like this..."
    ly "我以前并不是这样的..."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1303
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_0790997d:

    # ly "What you see in front of you now, picture the opposite."
    ly "你现在看到的，想象它的反面。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1304
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_098fbecf:

    # ly "I was this chunky, dorky girl who wore braces and sundresses because that's what my mom bought for me."
    ly "我那时候是个又胖又笨的女孩，戴牙套，穿连衣裙，因为我妈就买这些给我穿。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1306
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_2aba238b:

    # ly "And I've always been somewhat bright. That's also something people don't picture when they see me."
    ly "而且我一直以来都还算聪明。这也是人们看到我时想不到的事情。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1307
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_9191728e:

    # ly "If there is such a thing, I was too bright in school."
    ly "如果有的话，我在学校太聪明了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1308
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_c2f79932:

    # ly "You can figure out how classmates treat smart, fat, and ugly girls who get praised by teachers, especially when they feel too stupid in school themselves."
    ly "你可以想象一下，同学是怎么对待那些又聪明又胖又丑的女孩的，尤其是老师还经常表扬她们，而那些觉得自己在学校太笨的学生，反而会更讨厌她们。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1310
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_8b14a004:

    # mc "You were bullied, too?"
    mc "你也被欺负过？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1312
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_c295f9c4:

    # ly "Too, huh?"
    ly "“也”？你也经历过？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1314
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_a87a337b:

    # mc "Yep."
    mc "嗯。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1316
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_a94ace71:

    # ly "Then you know how it was like. To not have any friends or to sit alone at recess every day..."
    ly "那你肯定知道那种感觉。完全没有朋友，每天课间都一个人坐在那儿……"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1317
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_be338af7:

    # ly "...wishing the day would end so you could get back home and eat to feel something good."
    ly "……希望这一天快点结束，好回家吃点东西，感觉好点。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1319
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_96790bfe:

    # ly "That was me until high school."
    ly "直到高中我才改变。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1320
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_a1f086fc:

    # ly "We moved here, and I didn't know anyone, so this was my chance to start anew."
    ly "我们搬来这里，没人认识我，所以这正是我重新开始的机会。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1321
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_a1182970:

    # ly "I was so sick of my old self and wanted a change - any fucking change."
    ly "我早就受够了过去的自己，想要改变——任何他妈的改变。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1323
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_88a1d506:

    # ly "I didn't want to be this girl with no friends, so I changed everything about myself."
    ly "我不想做那个没有朋友的女孩，所以我把自己的一切都改了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1324
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_5ce307da:

    # ly "If everything I used to be was wrong in the eyes of others, I figured doing the opposite would take me where I wanted to go."
    ly "如果别人觉得我以前的样子不对，那我就做相反的事，这样我就能走到我想去的地方。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1326
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_02786141:

    # ly "I stopped eating, and my parents got concerned. I cut my clothes with scissors to make them look alternative."
    ly "我开始节食，父母开始担心。我用剪刀剪破衣服，想看起来更有个性。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1327
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_1b8d211e:

    # ly "I skipped school. I started smoking. I met the same kind of people and made friends."
    ly "我逃课了，开始抽烟，遇到了和我一样的人，交到了朋友。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1329
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_4557812c:

    # ly "All of a sudden I felt something different about myself. I felt accepted."
    ly "突然间，我感觉自己有些不一样了。我感觉被接受了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1330
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_e4afc9ea:

    # ly "But while doing that, I turned away others, and my family got increasingly worried about me."
    ly "但这么做让我疏远了别人，家人也越来越担心我。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1332
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_5d92b140:

    # ly "When I came back home with my tattoo, they were so angry. Mom screamed at me; Dad called it ugly and said I had ruined my skin."
    ly "我带着纹身回家，他们气坏了。我妈朝我大吼；我爸说那玩意儿丑，说我毁了皮肤。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1333
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_6a9765cb:

    # ly "Mom and Dad said I was throwing away everything I had going for me. They said they couldn't even recognize me anymore."
    ly "爸妈说我是在扔掉我所有能拥有的东西。他们说他们甚至认不出我了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1335
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_8ef15e8d:

    # ly "After graduating, I wanted to take a break from school, so I started working as a stripper."
    ly "毕业后，我想暂时不念书了，就去当了脱衣舞女。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1336
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_22d11013:

    # ly "When Mom and Dad found out, it was like a death knell. In their eyes, I was gone."
    ly "当爸妈知道后，就像判了死刑。在他们眼里，我彻底完了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1338
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_aa903b33:

    # ly "In a last-ditch effort, Dad told me to choose between living at home and working at The Pink Rose."
    ly "为了最后的尝试，我爸逼我选，要么继续住家里，要么去“粉红玫瑰”上班。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1339
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_7305531f:

    # ly "I don't know if he thought that would work, and it didn't. I moved out that weekend and shared a flat with a friend."
    ly "我不知道他是不是以为这样就能解决问题，结果也没成功。那周末我就搬出去了，和一个朋友合租了一个公寓。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1341
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_dbc34816:

    # ly "You can't please everyone, [name]. I made those choices, and I stand by them."
    ly "你不可能让所有人都满意[name]我做出了这些选择，并且坚持我的决定。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1342
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_e5d9e761:

    # ly "Even if it wasn't in the way my parents wished, I grew a lot from all of that."
    ly "即使没有按照我父母希望的方式，我从那些经历中学到了很多。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1343
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_d340c1bc:

    # ly "And that doesn't mean I'm throwing my life away. It's the opposite. I finally feel like I'm living it."
    ly "这并不代表我在挥霍人生。恰恰相反，我终于感觉到了真正的生活。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1345
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_07ce2d2a:

    # ly "So what if I make a joke about sucking your dick and people overhear?"
    ly "那又怎样，我开个玩笑说吸你那玩意儿，别人听到又如何？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1346
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_b1f33fa6:

    # ly "They'd think I was boring if I never did something like that. And if I do, they either think I'm fun, sexy or disgusting."
    ly "他们会觉得我太无聊了，如果我从不这么做。但要是我做了，他们又会觉得我要么很有趣，要么很性感，要么很恶心。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1347
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_fb39463c:

    # ly "There's no winning. But I can tell you this..."
    ly "没有必胜的法子。但我要告诉你的是……"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1349
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_099ce9ff:

    # ly "Not once have I regretted changing the way I did."
    ly "我从未后悔过我当初那样改变自己。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1350
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_02753377:

    # ly "I prefer this version of me a hell of a lot more than the sad, fat and pathetic Lily who cried herself to sleep."
    ly "我喜欢现在的自己多得多，总比那个又胖又可怜、每晚哭着睡着的Lily强。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1359
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_a714eeb4:

    # mc "Nor should you regret it. I think you turned out great."
    mc "你也不该后悔。我觉得你变得很好。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1361
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_e927c1e2:

    # ly "Thanks, [name]."
    ly "谢谢，[name]."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1362
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_f177a376:

    # ly "Don't tell anyone I told you this. Not a soul."
    ly "别把我说的这些告诉任何人。谁都不行。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1364
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_4c9a3011:

    # mc "Don't worry, I've got your back."
    mc "别担心，我罩着你。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1366
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_c6c18d8d:

    # ly "I told you this so that you'll understand me better."
    ly "我告诉你这些，是为了让你更了解我。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1368
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_46fe282c:

    # mc "Got it..."
    mc "明白了..."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1373
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_ed3fe0ba:

    # ly "This is not necessary, [name]."
    ly "这没有必要[name]."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1375
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_90f9d52f:

    # mc "For me, it is."
    mc "对我而言，就是这样。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1379
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_f177a376_1:

    # ly "Don't tell anyone I told you this. Not a soul."
    ly "别告诉任何人我跟你说这些。一个都不行。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1381
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_97cb072a:

    # mc "I felt sad hearing it."
    mc "听到这个我很难过。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1383
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_97591603:

    # ly "You don't have to feel sad. I don't feel sad anymore."
    ly "你不用觉得难过。我早就不再难过了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1384
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_c6c18d8d_1:

    # ly "I told you this so that you'll understand me better."
    ly "我告诉你这些，是为了让你更了解我。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1386
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_8e51f135:

    # mc "You have no idea how much it helped me do that."
    mc "你根本不知道这对我有多有帮助。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1395
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_0e90c10f:

    # ly "I won't start something with Sage if you're worried."
    ly "如果你担心，我不会去找Sage吵架。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1396
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_497f0b43:

    # ly "But I don't like her questioning what we're doing together. Don't let that get to you."
    ly "但我不喜欢她质疑我们在一起做什么。别让她的话影响到你。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1398
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_83574bc4:

    # mc "I make my own choices just like you did."
    mc "我也是自己做决定，就像你当初一样。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1400
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_aadb5c14:

    # ly "That's all I ask."
    ly "那就行了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1401
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_e3120b65:

    # ly "And I'll tone down the innuendos and sex talk a tad, but I'm not gonna stop. That's not me."
    ly "我会稍微收敛一点暧昧暗示和性暗示，但不会停下。那不是我的风格。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1403
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_8be9e4ed:

    # mc "Don't worry. Be yourself. That's why I want to roll with you."
    mc "别担心，做你自己。这就是我想和你一起的原因。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1405
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_lily_event_label_30941b37:

    # ly "I knew I picked you for a good reason."
    ly "我知道我选你是有原因的。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1420
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_298ddf39:

    # mc "Are you not big on decorations?"
    mc "你对装饰品也不太感兴趣？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1422
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_24116cc3:

    # cam "I'm not big on Christmas. We don't celebrate it in my family."
    cam "我不太喜欢圣诞节。我们家不庆祝这个节日。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1423
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_a38d79d3:

    # cam "I like the decorations, but I don't know what I dare to put up without Rio's consent."
    cam "我喜欢这些装饰，但我不确定在没有里奥同意的情况下，我敢挂什么。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1425
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_9862ff45:

    # cam "Knowing her, I'd have to redo everything because it isn't straight or doesn't look good enough, haha..."
    cam "知道她的话，我得重新来一遍，因为那些东西不直，或者看起来不够好，哈哈……"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1427
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_64480013:

    # mc "Is Riona still sick?"
    mc "Riona还没病好吗？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1429
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_80cbd78b:

    # cam "Yeah, she hasn't even stopped by to get any of her clothes."
    cam "她连来拿衣服都没来过。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1431
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_d6809432:

    # mc "It must be one hell of a bug. Is she ok?"
    mc "这该死的病毒一定很厉害。她没事吧？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1433
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_10530d84:

    # cam "She doesn't answer when I call but replies to some of my texts saying she's sick."
    cam "她不接我电话，但回了一些短信说她生病了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1434
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_322bd79f:

    # cam "I told her I was worried and even offered to bring her clothes and books, but she asked me to stay away."
    cam "我跟她说我担心，还主动提出带她衣服和课本过去，但她让我别管她。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1436
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_68e85144:

    # mc "Aw, poor Rio. I hope she gets better soon, she's gonna miss a lot of school."
    mc "唉，可怜的里奥，希望她早点好起来，不然会落下好多课。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1438
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_1c2e9ae4:

    # cam "Yeah, I know. She was already worried about her studies, thinking she wasn't doing well enough."
    cam "嗯，我知道。她本来就在担心学业，觉得自己成绩不够好。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1440
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_ca9b5c0c:

    # mc "I'd be stressed out if I were her. Do you think we can help her somehow?"
    mc "换作我，肯定压力很大。你觉得我们能帮她做点什么吗？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1442
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_314c19dc:

    # cam "We're not in any of her classes, so I doubt it. But you could always ask; I think she'd appreciate it."
    cam "我们又没上她的课，所以估计帮不上忙。不过你要是想问她，我觉得她应该会感激的。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1444
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_6fb1465c:

    # mc "Noted."
    mc "记下了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1445
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_8430e9b2:

    # mc "And hey, since she's not here, go nuts with the decorations. I think that will cheer her up."
    mc "而且，她不在的话，你们就放开手脚装饰吧。我觉得这样能让她开心点。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1447
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_96ef9d79:

    # cam "Haha, no. It would trigger her OCD."
    cam "哈哈，不。那会触发她的强迫症。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1448
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_camila_event_label_ffc51f14:

    # cam "She'd laugh at it, but I know it would make her feel more stressed, and she doesn't need that. I will stay conservative with the decorations."
    cam "她看到肯定会笑，但我知道这样只会让她更紧张，她现在可不需要这个。我打算保持低调，别搞太花哨的装饰。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1460
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_afd70294:

    # mc "Good job! It's starting to look Christmassy."
    mc "干得不错！已经开始有点圣诞气氛了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1462
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_7957236a:

    # sa "Yeah, it is. How is it going over at your place?"
    sa "嗯，是啊。你们那边进行得怎么样？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1464
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_2eab5519:

    # mc "We're doing fine. We've gotten a lot done so far."
    mc "我们挺好的，到目前为止已经干了不少活。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1466
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_62e9b678:

    # sa "I had a talk with Dawe earlier today. I don't know if the news reached you yet, but we have to attend their Christmas party."
    sa "我今天跟Dawe谈过。不知道你听说没有，我们得去参加他们的圣诞派对。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1468
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_a35d580b:

    # mc "What does that mean for us?"
    mc "这对我们有什么影响？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1470
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_01d0eb24:

    # sa "They chose the same date as you guys, and we made that deal with them...so..."
    sa "他们选了和你们一样的日期，而且我们和他们达成了协议……所以……"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1474
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_dc5da770:

    # mc "Can't you blow it off and come to ours instead?"
    mc "你不能就这么推掉，来我们这边吧？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1476
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_83eba836:

    # sa "The HOTs are honoring the deal, [name]. We have to."
    sa "HOTs正在履行协议[name]我们必须。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1478
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_ef7f13ef:

    # mc "All of you? What if they get a few of you and the rest come to our party?"
    mc "全都去？能不能一部分去他们那儿，剩下的来我们的派对？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1480
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_787b7fcd:

    # sa "I'm sorry, but no. It's not gonna happen. You'll have to do without us."
    sa "抱歉，不行。这样安排不了，你们那场只能没有我们了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1482
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_05283cbe:

    # mc "I understand. I'm aware of the deal."
    mc "我明白。我知道这个约定。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1484
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_4cd5a98b:

    # sa "I'm sorry. You'll have to do without us at your Christmas party."
    sa "抱歉，我们没法参加你们的圣诞派对了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1486
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_0f0f52e4:

    # mc "What about New Year's Eve?"
    mc "那新年夜呢？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1488
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_5cfb425e:

    # sa "We haven't decided yet, but I fear there will be a heated discussion. Honestly, it's hard to say what's fair."
    sa "我们还没决定，但我担心会有一场激烈的争论。说实话，很难说清楚什么才算公平。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1489
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_a5db071e:

    # sa "It sounded like a good idea when we made the deal, but in reality, it's tricky to navigate without pissing anyone off."
    sa "当时听起来是个好主意，但实际情况是，不惹恼任何人地搞定这件事还真不容易。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1491
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_8f29a3e0:

    # sa "Dawe was gloating after I said we were coming to the jocks' Christmas party."
    sa "我一答应去那帮体育生的圣诞派对，Dawe就得意得不行。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1493
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_ec92a474:

    # mc "Before you agree to anything else, include us in the discussion. We want you with us on New Year's Eve."
    mc "在你同意任何其他事情之前，先把我们纳入讨论。我们想在新年之夜有你陪着。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1495
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_3c882087:

    # sa "This is hard, [name]."
    sa "这很难，[name]."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1502
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_30932165:

    # mc "I know, but I think you're doing great. It's not easy to please everyone. It's impossible even."
    mc "我知道，但我觉得你做得很好。要让每个人都满意真的很难，甚至根本不可能。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1504
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_986f33b9:

    # sa "Thank you."
    sa "谢谢。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1506
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_260a8af2:

    # mc "I bet it is."
    mc "想也知道很难。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1509
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_b51f1537:

    # mc "I get it, but don't let the jocks win."
    mc "我明白，但别让那些橄榄球队的家伙赢了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1511
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_a1546f56:

    # sa "That's not what I'm doing. Didn't you listen? I'm trying to be fair to everyone."
    sa "这可不是我干的事。你没听明白吗？我是在努力对每个人公平。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1513
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_sage_event_label_ab50a1fc:

    # mc "I know. I'm just saying."
    mc "我知道。我只是说说。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1526
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_da_event_label_29cae23d:

    # ash "Here we go."
    ash "来了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1528
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_da_event_label_1df91dca:

    # ash "Ouch!"
    ash "哎哟！"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1529
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_da_event_label_7791f87e:

    # de "What's wrong?"
    de "怎么了？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1531
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_da_event_label_6127c880:

    # ash "The stupid wreath pricked my finger."
    ash "那个蠢蠢的花环扎到了我的手指。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1533
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_da_event_label_0fc42b45:

    # de "It doesn't look like much; you'll be fine."
    de "看起来没多大问题，你没事的。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1535
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_da_event_label_dad4c38a:

    # ash "Of course, I'll be fine. That's not the point. It stung like crazy."
    ash "当然，我没事。那不是重点。它疼得要命。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1537
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_da_event_label_5d3816e7:

    # de "I can hang the wreath for you."
    de "我可以帮你挂这个花环。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1539
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_da_event_label_09d80a03:

    # ash "No. This is why you need me here. You won't put it straight."
    ash "不行，所以才需要我。你会挂歪的。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1541
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_da_event_label_e726a409:

    # de "It's all yours, but watch your fingers."
    de "这全交给你了，但注意别扎到手。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1552
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_060c6a4f:

    # qu "Yeah?"
    qu "嗯？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1554
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_0797de43:

    # mc "It's been too long now, Quinn. We've stopped talking. You don't contact me or try to initiate conversation anymore."
    mc "Quinn，这样已经很久了。我们几乎不说话，你也不再联系我，或者主动找我聊了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1555
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_cce78b38:

    # mc "And you're not giving me a lot when I try to talk to you."
    mc "你在我主动跟你说话的时候，给的回应也不多。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1557
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_a4eaca90:

    # qu "[name], I'm not ready."
    qu "[name]我还没准备好。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1559
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_9bc847f1:

    # mc "Ready for what?"
    mc "准备好什么？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1561
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_a0aca6d5:

    # qu "To share things with you."
    qu "和你分享一些事情。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1565
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_90408f6b:

    # mc "Did I do something wrong? I thought I made it clear that you can trust me with it."
    mc "我是不是做错了什么？我以为我已经让你明白，你可以信任我。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1567
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_97f604fe:

    # mc "Is this about Lily or something else?"
    mc "是因为Lily，还是别的事？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1570
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_58c49e30:

    # qu "It's not about Lily, and it's not about you."
    qu "不是因为Lily，也不是因为你。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1572
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_8e29e1bc:

    # qu "It's not about you."
    qu "这不关你的事。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1574
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_08b5df7f:

    # mc "Ok."
    mc "好的。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1578
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_c1092ee9:

    # qu "[name], no."
    qu "[name]不。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1580
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_16c172b4:

    # mc "You'd feel better."
    mc "你会感觉好点。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1582
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_c6832303:

    # qu "I won't."
    qu "我不会。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1591
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_121862fc:

    # qu "What do you want?"
    qu "你想要什么？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1593
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_9fb70a8b:

    # mc "Nothing. Just checking what's up."
    mc "没什么。就是看看情况怎么样。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1595
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_1d365e25:

    # qu "Not much."
    qu "没什么事。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1597
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_1c249334:

    # mc "Alright... I'm helping up with decorations and such..."
    mc "好啊……我正帮忙布置些装饰什么的……"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1598
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1599
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_95835db3:

    # mc "I...should get back to it."
    mc "我……该回去干活了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1603
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_121862fc_1:

    # qu "What do you want?"
    qu "你想要什么？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1605
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_9fb70a8b_1:

    # mc "Nothing. Just checking what's up."
    mc "没什么。就是来看看情况。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1607
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_437eba86:

    # qu "Go away. I've got nothing to say to you."
    qu "滚开。我没什么好说的。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1609
translate schinese ep11_fr_deco_q_event_label_7f4a83a7:

    # mc "(Moody...)"
    mc "（脾气真差……）"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1621
translate schinese ep11_pp_label_ccf4cd36:

    # mc "(One kickass party coming up...)"
    mc "（一个超棒的派对要来了……）"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1623
translate schinese ep11_pp_label_7471bbf5:

    # mc "(WWTD?)"
    mc "（换作汤米会怎么做？）"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1624
translate schinese ep11_pp_label_51f18a4e:

    # mc "(He'd think a pure Christmas party is lame. Like he told Jamie, he wants girls to sit in his lap.)"
    mc "（他觉得纯正的圣诞派对很无聊。就像他跟Jamie说的，他想要女孩坐他腿上。）"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1625
translate schinese ep11_pp_label_3ed4274d:

    # mc "(Tommy cares about keeping the party sexy.)"
    mc "（Tommy在乎的是派对够不够性感。）"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1627
translate schinese ep11_pp_label_9fb7b1ad:

    # mc "(And I have no fucking problem with that. That's easy to fix...)"
    mc "（这我他妈完全没意见。很容易办到……）"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1629
translate schinese ep11_pp_label_3930c6dc:

    # mc "(It will be outside my comfort zone to plan a sexy party without him, but... WWTD?)"
    mc "（没他帮忙，策划这种性感派对对我来说有点难，不过……换作汤米会怎么做？）"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1631
translate schinese ep11_pp_label_75fdcddf:

    # mc "(I should be able to manage that... Yeah...)"
    mc "（我应该能搞定……嗯……）"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1633
translate schinese ep11_pp_label_fac04184:

    # mc "(It will be a Christmas party...but...)"
    mc "（这会是一场圣诞派对……不过……）"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1636
translate schinese ep11_pp_label_8e76f5a8:

    # tm "And before you go asking me for advice again, let me say what I think."
    tm "而且在你又想让我给建议之前，我想说说我的看法。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_diks_events.rpy:1637
